      ------------------------------
 352   /B-MAIZE       MAIZE PRODUCTION,                      B-MIX-04      CROP 
      MIX IN 2004,
 353    B-RICE        RICE PRODUCTION,                       B-MIX-05      CROP 
      MIX IN 2005,
 354    B-CASSAVA     CASSAVA PRODUCTION,                    B-MIX-06      CROP 
      MIX IN 2006,
 355    B-POTATOES    POTATOES PRODUCTION,                   B-MIX-07      CROP 
      MIX IN 2007,
 356    B-BEANS       BEANS PRODUCTION,                      B-MIX-08      CROP 
      MIX IN 2008,
 357    B-GROUNDNUTS  GROUNDNUTS PRODUCTION,                 B-MIX-09      CROP 
      MIX IN 2009,
 358    B-MIX-00      CROP MIX IN 2000,                      B-MIX-01      CROP 
      MIX IN 2001,
 359    B-MIX-02      CROP MIX IN 2002,                      B-MIX-03      CROP 
      MIX IN 2003/;
