1915   
1916   
1917  * FOR PRODUCTION ACTIVITIES MAPPED TO CROP AND LIVESTOCK BUDGETS, CALCULAT
      E THE INPUT AND OUTPUT
1918  * COEFFICIENTS.  IF A COEFFICIENT VALUE HAS BEEN ASSIGNED TO THE ACTIVITY 
      AND THAT ACTIVITY IS MAPPED TO
1919  * A CROP OR LIVESTOCK BUDGET, THE COEFFICIENT IS REASSIGNED TO ITS CURRENT
       VALUE PLUS THE BUDGET VALUE
1920  * TIMES THE CORRESPONDING MULTIPLIER.  COEFFICIENTS FOR OTHER CONSTRAINTS 
      ARE COMPUTED THE SAME WAY.
