DATA CHECKS AND DISPLAY


2035  * THE FOLLOWING SETS ARE CONSTRUCTED TO SEE IF INPUTS, PRODUCTS, BUDGETS, 
      OR CONSTRAINTS AND ACTIVITIES
2036  * LACK INDICATED UNITS OR IF DUPLICATE UNITS ARE SPECIFIED.  INPUT AND PRO
      DUCT ITEMS DO NOT NEED BUDGET
2037  * UNITS IF THEY DO NO APPEAR IN A CROP OR LIVESTOCK BUDGET
2038   
2039  SET  ICK01(JBC)  BUDGETS WITH NO UNITS SPECIFIED;
2040  SET  ICK02(JBC)  BUDGETS WITH DUPLICATE UNITS SPECIFIED;
2041  SET  ICK03(JXC)  ACTIVITIES WITH NO UNITS SPECIFIED;
2042  SET  ICK04(JXC)  ACTIVITIES WITH DUPLICATE UNITS SPECIFIED;
2043  SET  ICK05(JBC,JXC)  BUDGET - ACTIVITY COMBOS W ZERO CONVERSION MULT;
2044   
2045  SET  ICK06(JIP)  INPUTS AND PRODUCTS USED IN CROP OR LIVESTOCK BUDGETS;
2046  SET  ICK07(JIP)  INPUTS AND PRODUCTS W NO BUDGET UNITS SPECIFIED;
2047  SET  ICK08(JIP)  INPUTS AND PRODUCTS W DUPLICATE BUDGET UNITS SPECIFIED;
2048  SET  ICK09(JIP)  INPUTS AND PRODUCTS W NO MODEL UNITS SPECIFIED;
2049  SET  ICK10(JIP)  INPUTS AND PRODUCTS W DUPLICATE MODEL UNITS SPECIFIED;
2050  SET  ICK11(JIP)  INPUTS AND PRODUCTS W ZERO CONVERSION MULT;
